<article class="env-example" id="DAB83D">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/DAB83D">Example <span data-tag="DAB83D">5.5.1.8</span>.</a> The $\infty $-category $\SSet $ of spaces is presentable. This follows from characterization $(1)$ of Theorem <a href="/tag/170748" data-tag="170748">5.5.1.1</a>, since $\SSet $ is accessible (Example <a href="/tag/00DAF3" data-tag="00DAF3">5.4.2.7</a>) and admits (small) colimits by Corollary <a href="/tag/A4ADC1" data-tag="A4ADC1">4.2.4.8</a>. </p>
